n=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,1)\">Exod 8:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,12)\">Exod 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,13)\">Exod 8:13</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), and of Egyptian magicians <ref ref=\"Exod 7:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,12)\">Exod 7:12</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); compare Aaron's rod that budded <ref ref=\"Num 17:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,18)\">Num 17:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,21)\">Num 17:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,23)\">Num 17:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,25)\">Num 17:25</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup>Semitic i. 180; 2d ed. 197</sup></lookup>); carried even by warrior <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,27)\">1Sam 14:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:43\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,43)\">1Sam 14:43</ref> <bdbheb>מַטֵּה שִׁכְמוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,3)\">Isa 9:3</ref> i.e. rod that strikes his shoulder, task-master's rod (|| <bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט הַנֹּגֵשׂ בּוֺ</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Isa 10:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,5)\">Isa 10:5</ref> and v<ref ref=\"Isa 10:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,24)\">Isa 10:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 14:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,5)\">Isa 14:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט</bdbheb>), all figurative of oppression; <bdbheb>מַטֵּה מוּסָדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:32\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,32)\">Isa 30:32</ref> <highlight>appointed rod</highlight> (of punishment); compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,10)\">Ezek 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,11)\">Ezek 7:11</ref> (but text obscure, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> — q. v. — <highlight>sceptre)</highlight>, also <ref ref=\"Mic 6:9\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,9)\">Mic 6:9</ref> according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, but see below <b>3</b>; <highlightword>used in beating out</highlightword> (<bdbheb>חבט</bdbheb>) fennel <ref ref=\"Isa 28:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,27)\">Isa 28:27</ref> <highlight>staff</highlight> as badge of leader or ruler <bdbheb>מַטֵּהעֹֿז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 48:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,17)\">Jer 48:17</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַקֵּל</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Ps 110:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"110\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"110\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,110,2)\">Ps 110:2</ref> so <ref ref=\"Num 17:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,17)\">Num 17:17</ref> (4 t. in verse) + 10 t. <ref ref=\"Num 17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,1)\">Num 17</ref> apparently <highlight>shafts</highlight>, i.e. arrows or spears, <ref ref=\"Hab 3:9\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,9)\">Hab 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 3:14\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,14)\">Hab 3:14</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>branch</highlight> of vine <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,11)\">Ezek 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,12)\">Ezek 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,14)\">Ezek 19:14</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>tribe</highlight> (183 t.), originally company led by chief with <highlight>staff:</highlight> specifically of tribes of Israel in both singular and plural, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,14)\">1Kgs 7:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,1)\">1Kgs 8:1</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,2)\">2Chr 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,2)\">Exod 31:2</ref> + 5 t. Exodus; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,11)\">Lev 24:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,4)\">Num 1:4</ref> + 89 t. Numbers; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,1)\">Josh 7:1</ref> + 56 t. Joshua (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:45\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,45)\">1Chr 6:45</ref> + 21 t. <ref ref=\"1Chr 6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,1)\">1Chr 6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,31)\">1Chr 12:31</ref> probably also <ref ref=\"Mic 6:9\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,9)\">Mic 6:9</ref> (vocative; so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm</lookup>). — compare <bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט</bdbheb>, and on relation of these two words for <highlight>tribe</highlight> Hebrew usage <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>JPhoenician xi. (1882), 213 f</sup></lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 4:17", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Mic 6:9", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 6, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Eccl 48:2", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 48, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Eccl 45:6", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 45, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Eccl 45:25", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 45, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Gen 38:25", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 38, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Exod 4:20", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Gen 38:18", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 38, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Exod 8:1", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Isa 10:24", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "1Kgs 8:1", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 8, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Exod 7:12", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Num 17:21", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 17, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Hab 3:14", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 10:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ezek 4:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 4, "ve